WEBVTT

00:17:28.427 --> 00:17:31.778
we're going to empower the patient,
enable the doctor, enhance wellness

00:17:31.802 --> 00:17:34.249
and begin to cure the well
before they get sick.

00:17:34.273 --> 00:17:37.811
Because I know as a doctor, if someone
comes to me with stage I disease,

00:17:37.835 --> 00:17:39.626
I'm thrilled; we can often cure them.

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:40.820
But often it's too late,

00:17:40.844 --> 00:17:42.973
and it's stage III or IV
cancer, for example.

00:17:42.997 --> 00:17:45.112
So by leveraging
these technologies together,

00:17:45.136 --> 00:17:48.373
I think we'll enter a new era
that I like to call stage 0 medicine.

00:17:48.397 --> 00:17:51.666
And as a cancer doctor,
I'm looking forward to being out of a job.

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:52.912
Thanks very much.

00:17:52.936 --> 00:17:54.914
(Applause)

00:17:54.938 --> 00:17:56.635
Host: Thank you. Thank you.

00:17:56.659 --> 00:17:58.459
(Applause)

00:17:58.483 --> 00:18:00.483
Take a bow, take a bow.